---
args: { prepared: PreparedEvidence, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Convert landholder and ecological goals into observable objectives under supplied guidance. Separate desired long-term outcomes from near-term actions, identify conflicting uses, and preserve uncertainty about causal pathways rather than promising guaranteed ecological results.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
